OL,3,GNEWSACity-wide fortnightly bin rounds
OL,4,Acould start by February
OL,5,
OL,6,FFortnightly bin collections could be
OL,7,Frolled out to all households in
OL,8,FBirmingham in February.
OL,10,FThe city council has proposed extending
OL,11,Fa pilot scheme that replaced weekly
OL,12,Frubbish collections with fortnightly
OL,13,Fones, alongside weekly food waste
OL,14,Fpickups and a second recycling bin.
OL,16,FThe decision follows trials of two
OL,17,Fdifferent waste collection models
OL,18,Facross the city. One, in north
OL,19,FBirmingham and Sutton Coldfield,
OL,20,Fintroduced fortnightly general waste
OL,21,Fcollections, while the other retained
OL,22,Fweekly collections.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
