OL,3,GNEWSACity-wide fortnightly bin rounds
OL,4,Acould start by February
OL,5,
OL,6,FA report recommended adopting the first
OL,7,Fmodel, with the waste service
OL,8,Ftransformation expected to restart from
OL,9,FFebruary. Bulky waste collections
OL,10,Fshould also be reintroduced.
